Author:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Wed Jun 19 11:28:50 2024 +0200
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Wed Jun 19 11:28:50 2024 +0200

    Bug 1903248 - Fix more issues in the schema files. r=mkmelin


    While working on https://github.com/thunderbird/webext-schemas
    and generating the actual API documentation, a few more issues appeared.

    One is a mistake I made: it should be `<var>` and not `<val>`. Other
    issues are:

     * remove single back tick reStructuredText notation
     * replace reStructuredText :doc:`...` notation by firefox notation
     * replace all links by placeholders and no longer use | notation

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D214178

